@broadcast "Chrome & Circumstance - Episode 3: Memory Leak"
@channel ksab_tv
@category comedy
@length 180
@type scripted

::actors
@actor npc_vic
@alias npc_vic VIC

@actor npc_lex
@alias npc_lex LEX

@actor npc_helpbot
@alias npc_helpbot HELPBOT
::endactors



::scene TITLE

EVENT FADE_IN

TITLE architect_svg

♪ A loud synthwave theme pulses with neon energy. ♪

TICKER
CORPORATION DENIES REPLACING EMPLOYEES WITH CHEAPER EMPLOYEES • CYBER EYES NOW INCLUDE ADS DURING BLINKS • CITY PARKING METERS ACHIEVE SENTIENCE •
TICKER_END

EVENT DISSOLVE

::scene APARTMENT

ROOM zone_megablock

CAM 1 WIDE

SHOT
A tiny apartment sits twenty stories above a sea of neon. Every appliance hums louder than necessary, and the refrigerator occasionally thanks someone for their loyalty.
SHOT_END

NPC npc_vic
NPC npc_lex

EVENT APPLAUSE

VIC:
Morning.

LEX:
It's three in the afternoon.

VIC:
Then why am I awake?

EVENT LAUGHTER

LEX:
Your neural implant downloaded an update.

VIC:
Again?

LEX:
Apparently you agreed to automatic optimism.

VIC:
Can I uninstall that?

EVENT LAUGHTER

::scene GLITCH

CAM 2 MEDIUM

SHOT
Vic blinks. A bright holographic advertisement appears directly in front of his face.
SHOT_END

VIC:
Why am I seeing ads?

LEX:
Premium Vision expired.

VIC:
I paid for lifetime access.

LEX:
You did.

LEX:
Your lifetime subscription ended yesterday.

EVENT LAUGHTER

ENTER helpbot

CAM 3 CLOSEUP helpbot

SHOT
A cheerful customer service drone floats into the apartment carrying complimentary paperwork.
SHOT_END

HELPBOT:
Congratulations!

HELPBOT:
You've been selected for mandatory customer satisfaction.

EVENT LAUGHTER

VIC:
I'm not satisfied.

HELPBOT:
Response recorded as "extremely satisfied."

EVENT APPLAUSE
EVENT LAUGHTER

::scene SUPPORT

CAM 4 MEDIUM

SHOT
The drone projects an enormous holographic troubleshooting menu containing thousands of tiny buttons.
SHOT_END

HELPBOT:
Please describe your issue.

VIC:
Memory problems.

HELPBOT:
Wonderful.

HELPBOT:
Would you like to forget your memory problems?

EVENT LAUGHTER

VIC:
No!

HELPBOT:
Issue resolved.

ACTION npc_helpbot begins printing a receipt that never seems to end.

EVENT LAUGHTER

::scene ENDING

CAM 1 WIDE

SHOT
The receipt coils across the apartment floor, wraps around the furniture, and disappears out the window into the neon streets below.
SHOT_END

LEX:
At least it's free paper.

VIC:
It's a digital receipt.

LEX:
...

LEX:
That's somehow worse.

EVENT APPLAUSE
EVENT LAUGHTER

::scene CREDITS

CAM 2 WIDE

SHOT
The camera slowly pulls away from the apartment as the endless receipt continues unspooling into the skyline, while HELPBOT politely apologizes for the inconvenience without ever stopping.
SHOT_END

♪ The synthwave theme returns over the closing credits. ♪

EVENT FADE_OUT

END